1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,780
Reading Protecting Pandas Simon is reading an article by a panda-keeper.

2
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:10,850
Here is the article.

3
00:00:10,850 --> 00:00:14,820
She Wong in safe hands.

4
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:18,810
Tiny, pink and quiet with eyes closed.

5
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:24,420
She Wong was just one hundred grams when I first saw her.

6
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:27,430
Her birth brought much happiness to us.

7
00:00:27,430 --> 00:00:31,950
We named her She Wong because it means hope.

8
00:00:31,950 --> 00:00:37,820
In the beginning, She Wong couldn't see, hear or even move.

9
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:40,880
We gave her round-the-clock care.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,610
At six months old, she began to eat bamboo.

11
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:50,030
Half a year later, she weighed over 35 kilograms.

12
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:58,230
There is nothing more satisfying than seeing She Wong grow into a big ball of fur.

13
00:00:58,230 --> 00:01:03,610
When she was 20 months old, she learnt to look after herself.

14
00:01:03,610 --> 00:01:06,870
She Wong has a happy life here.

15
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:12,320
However, giant pandas in the wild face serious problems.

16
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:15,380
They are very special animals.

17
00:01:15,380 --> 00:01:18,470
It is difficult for them to have babies.

18
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:24,780
Even if baby pandas are born, they may easily get sick and die.

19
00:01:24,780 --> 00:01:32,510
Also, they live mainly on bamboo, but the bamboo forests are becoming smaller and smaller.

20
00:01:32,510 --> 00:01:39,300
As a result, pandas may not have a place to live or enough food to eat.

21
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:42,370
Luckily, the government has taken action.

22
00:01:42,370 --> 00:01:50,030
There are laws to protect giant pandas and more nature reserves for them to live in.

23
00:01:50,030 --> 00:01:56,000
What's more, scientists are working hard to help pandas have more babies.

24
00:01:56,000 --> 00:02:01,470
Thanks to all the efforts, the number of giant pandas is increasing.

25
00:02:01,470 --> 00:02:04,540
But they still need our protection.

26
00:02:04,540 --> 00:02:08,140
We believe things will get better and better.

27
00:02:08,140 --> 00:02:11,560
For where there is She Wong, there is hope.
